<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">ZJK Industrial Co., Ltd. (the &#8220;Company&#8221;)
is furnishing this Form 6-K to provide (i) unaudited consolidated financial statements for the six months ended June 30, 2025 and 2026
and related notes, attached hereto as Exhibit 99.1, (ii) operating and financial review and prospects for the six months ended June 30,
2025 and 2026, attached hereto as Exhibit 99.2, and (iii) press release titled &#8220;ZJK Industrial Co., Ltd. Reports Financial Results
for First Half of Fiscal Year 2026,&#8221; attached hereto as Exhibit 99.3.</p>

